      "cat-harness:section": "Covers",
      "prov:value": "- Declared visualiser `cat-harness/kg` (cat-harness `visualisers`, `renderedBy: kg-viewer`, owner 2026-10-20: \"move graph viewer so aligns\"). With `kg-viewer.ts --site <dir>` the page is written at `<base>/en/cat-harness/kg/` and reads `../../../cat-harness.jsonld`; `<base>/cat-harness/` becomes a forwarding page, because that address is the instance as itself. The bullets below describe the page as drawn on 2026-09-23, at its address then.",
