      "@id": "docs/wireframes/kg-viewer/intent.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Findings",
      "prov:value": "## Update, 2026-10-02: findings re-measured and worked (bean `yhcq`, issue #1838)\n\nRe-measured on a local build of `main` cf3e62487, with the viewer generated by `kg-viewer.ts --out <site>/cat-harness/index.html` as `docs-site.yml` does, at 1280×800 and 390×844. Pictures in `rendered-2026-10-02/`. The as-is drawing above is NOT re-drawn.\n\n1. **No longer holds.** At 390 before any facet, `scrollWidth` is 390 and `main` is `390px`. The grid track is clamped now.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean yhcq",
        "#1838",
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/wireframes/kg-viewer/intent.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Update, 2026-10-02: findings re-measured and worked (bean `yhcq`, issue #1838)",
      "prov:value": "7. **Still holds, by design.** All five `.po` catalogues have 0 translated entries, so the switcher correctly offers nothing. The three new strings are added to each catalogue as empty stubs. This needs translation work, not a viewer change, and is an open question on the PR.\n8. **Fixed.** A \"← Docs site\" link (`../`) at the top, translated with the rest of the chrome.\n\n## Update, 2026-10-02 (later): finding 7 — the switcher is shown, disabled (bean `w6fu`, issue #1838)\n\nThe owner ruled on #1839's question 2: **show the switcher, disabled**, so readers can see translations are planned. Finding 7 is now **fixed** by that ruling rather than held by design.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean w6fu",
        "#1838",
        "#1839",
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
